title: "Community Life & Adolescent Development (CLAD)"
abstract: >-
  Study resources, analysis code, and the clad-glimmer research-object graph for the
  Community Life & Adolescent Development study (NIJ 2016-R2-CX-0019, Wave-4/Visit-7),
  the empirical basis for the PhD dissertation "Adolescent Neurocognitive Maturity
  Mediates Paths to Altered Social Norms & Vulnerability in Emerging Adulthood".
